## Test Implementation

### Test Structure
```php
class ExampleTest extends TestCase {
  /**
   * @test
   * @group feature
   * @covers ExampleClass::exampleMethod
   */
  public function it_should_perform_expected_action() {
    // Arrange
    $input = $this->createTestInput();
    $expected = $this->getExpectedOutput();
    
    // Act
    $result = $this->subject->performAction($input);
    
    // Assert
    $this->assertEquals($expected, $result);
    $this->assertExpectedSideEffects();
  }
}
```

