## Test Automation

### CI/CD Integration
```yaml
test_pipeline:
  stages:
    - lint
    - unit
    - integration
    - feature
    - performance
    - security
  
  rules:
    - if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == "main"
      when: always
    - if: $CI_MERGE_REQUEST_ID
      when: always
```

### Automated Testing
```json
{
  "automation": {
    "schedule": {
      "unit": "every commit",
      "integration": "hourly",
      "feature": "daily",
      "performance": "weekly"
    },
    "triggers": {
      "pull_request": ["unit", "integration"],
      "merge": ["feature", "performance"],
